ValueError: 'image' (shape (0, 9)) must have either 3 or 4 dimensions.
ValueError: inner 3 dims of 'image.shape' must be > 0: (1, 91, 0, 86)
ValueError: offset_height must be >= 0.
ValueError: target_width must be > 0.
ValueError: width must be >= target + offset.

